WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.067
You have an account, and Popkins waiting. This is how you come back.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.162
Sign in asks one thing: your phone number or email. Choose Send my code. Still no

00:00:13.162 --> 00:00:14.099
passwords.

00:00:14.299 --> 00:00:18.747
An email that can't be right is marked: That email doesn’t look quite right.

00:00:18.947 --> 00:00:21.577
On a wide display, it is a split screen.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.912
Enter the six digits, and My Popkins opens.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.720
Each active Popkin is a card in its colour: the latest message and who sent it,

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.618
faces and a count of the rest, and the time left. One day six hours left, Ongoing,

00:00:37.618 --> 00:00:39.591
or Until November thirtieth.

00:00:39.791 --> 00:00:41.812
A badge counts unread messages.

00:00:42.012 --> 00:00:45.392
Wrapped up lists the Popkins that have ended, each marked Recap.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.201
When a message arrives, its badge goes up, and its card moves first.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.639
On a phone, the cards are one across, and New Popkin floats.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.248
From six hundred and forty pixels, two across.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.596
From seven sixty-eight, New Popkin is in the header.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.145
From ten twenty-four, three across.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.601
Sign in with a number that has no account, and nothing looks different. After the

00:01:12.601 --> 00:01:15.343
code, Popkin asks: What should we call you?

00:01:15.543 --> 00:01:20.933
Then My Popkins says No Popkins yet, and offers Start a Popkin, and Scan to join.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.440
Scan to join opens the camera, with a frame to hold the QR code in.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:30.845
Another QR code? That’s not a Popkin code, and scanning goes on.

00:01:31.045 --> 00:01:34.161
A Popkin's code: Found it. Opening your invite.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:41.042
If the camera is refused, the dialog says how to allow it, and offers Type the code

00:01:41.042 --> 00:01:43.408
instead, and Try the camera again.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.458
While your Popkins load, cards the size of the real ones hold their place.

00:01:48.658 --> 00:01:52.030
If they can't be loaded, the screen says so, with Try again.

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:56.840
Lose your connection, and a banner says: You’re offline. Showing what we saved last

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:57.418
time.

00:01:57.618 --> 00:02:01.083
And a screen that was never loaded says it needs a connection.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:06.683
What no screen shows, the tests prove: asking for a code answers the same with or

00:02:06.683 --> 00:02:09.989
without an account, and a session lasts thirty days.

00:02:10.189 --> 00:02:13.753
Still to come: Join with a code, the recap, and your account.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.574
That is journey six. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
